    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Cookie Policy | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Read the KASODI Cookie Policy and learn about cookies, similar technologies and third-party services that may be encountered when using our website."
    />
  </head>

  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="policy-page">

      <section class="policy-hero">

        <p class="policy-eyebrow">
          TRANSPARENCY
        </p>

        <h1>
          Cookie Policy
        </h1>

        <p class="policy-intro">
          This Cookie Policy explains how cookies and similar technologies may
          be used in connection with KASODI and what happens when you follow
          links from our website to third-party services.
        </p>

        <p class="policy-updated">
          Last updated: August 2026
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="policy-content">


        <div class="policy-section">

          <span class="policy-number">01</span>

          <div>

            <h2>What are cookies?</h2>

            <p>
              Cookies are small text files or similar technologies that websites
              may store on or access from a user's device. They can be used for
              purposes such as providing website functionality, remembering
              preferences, maintaining security, measuring website performance
              or supporting advertising.
            </p>

            <p>
              Different websites and services use cookies in different ways.
              Some cookies may be necessary for a service to operate, while
              others may be used for analytics, personalization or marketing.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>


        <div class="policy-section">

          <span class="policy-number">02</span>

          <div>

            <h2>Cookies on KASODI</h2>

            <p>
              KASODI currently does not intentionally deploy analytics or
              advertising cookies through services such as Google Analytics,
              Meta Pixel or Pinterest Tag.
            </p>

            <p>
              We also currently do not use website accounts, newsletter
              subscription forms or embedded social media feeds that would
              intentionally introduce additional tracking technologies through
              those features.
            </p>

            <p>
              The technical infrastructure used to host, deliver, protect or
              operate the website may nevertheless process technical
              information or use technologies necessary to provide the service
              reliably and securely.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>


        <div class="policy-section">

          <span class="policy-number">03</span>

          <div>

            <h2>Affiliate links</h2>

            <p>
              KASODI uses affiliate links to selected retailers, marketplaces,
              brands and affiliate networks.
            </p>

            <p>
              Our current affiliate relationships include Amazon.es through
              the Amazon Associates Program and the Temu Affiliate Program.
            </p>

            <p>
              When you click an affiliate link, you leave KASODI and are
              directed to a third-party website. That third party may use
              cookies or similar technologies in accordance with its own
              privacy and cookie policies, including technologies that may
              help attribute a qualifying purchase to an affiliate referral.
            </p>

            <p>
              KASODI does not control the cookies or tracking technologies
              placed by third-party websites after you leave our website.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>


        <div class="policy-section">

          <span class="policy-number">04</span>

          <div>

            <h2>Social media links</h2>

            <p>
              KASODI may provide ordinary external links to our profiles on
              Instagram, Facebook and Pinterest.
            </p>

            <p>
              KASODI currently does not embed social media feeds or similar
              social media widgets on the website.
            </p>

            <p>
              If you choose to follow an external link to a social media
              platform, that service may use cookies and similar technologies
              according to its own policies.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>


        <div class="policy-section">

          <span class="policy-number">05</span>

          <div>

            <h2>Analytics and marketing technologies</h2>

            <p>
              KASODI currently does not use Google Analytics, Meta Pixel,
              Pinterest Tag or similar analytics or advertising tracking
              technologies on the website.
            </p>

            <p>
              We may introduce analytics or other technologies in the future
              to better understand how visitors use KASODI or to support the
              development of the website.
            </p>

            <p>
              If technologies requiring user consent are introduced, we will
              update this Cookie Policy and implement an appropriate consent
              mechanism where required.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>


        <div class="policy-section">

          <span class="policy-number">06</span>

          <div>

            <h2>Managing cookies in your browser</h2>

            <p>
              Most web browsers allow you to view, manage, block or delete
              cookies through the browser settings.
            </p>

            <p>
              The exact controls depend on the browser and device you use.
              Blocking certain cookies may affect the functionality of some
              websites or services you visit.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>


        <div class="policy-section">

          <span class="policy-number">07</span>

          <div>

            <h2>Third-party websites</h2>

            <p>
              This Cookie Policy applies to KASODI. It does not govern cookies
              or similar technologies used independently by websites operated
              by retailers, affiliate partners, social media platforms or
              other third parties.
            </p>

            <p>
              We encourage you to review the privacy and cookie information
              provided by any third-party website you choose to visit.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>


        <div class="policy-section">

          <span class="policy-number">08</span>

          <div>

            <h2>Changes to this Cookie Policy</h2>

            <p>
              KASODI may update this Cookie Policy as the website develops,
              particularly if we introduce analytics, advertising, newsletter
              services, embedded content or other technologies.
            </p>

            <p>
              Any updated version will be published on this page and the
              “Last updated” date will be revised.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>


        <div class="policy-section">

          <span class="policy-number">09</span>

          <div>

            <h2>Contact</h2>

            <p>
              If you have questions about this Cookie Policy, you can contact
              KASODI at:
            </p>

            <a
              class="policy-email"
              href="mailto:kasodi.info@gmail.com"
            >
              kasodi.info@gmail.com
            </a>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="policy-final">

        <p class="policy-eyebrow">
          KASODI
        </p>

        <h2>
          Thoughtful curation, with transparency built in.
        </h2>

        <a href="/#collections" class="product-shop-button">
          Explore the Collection →
        </a>

      </section>

    </main>


   <Footer />
   
  </body>
</html>


<style>

  .policy-page {
    background: #f8f5ef;
    color: #29251f;
  }


  .policy-hero {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 110px 40px 100px;
    text-align: center;
  }


  .policy-eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 25px;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #917552;
  }


  .policy-hero h1 {
    margin: 0 auto 35px;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 78px);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }


  .policy-intro {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #5e574d;
  }


  .policy-updated {
    margin: 30px 0 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #8b8378;
  }


  .policy-content {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 20px 40px 120px;
  }


  .policy-section {
    padding: 60px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(41, 37, 31, 0.15);

    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 90px 1fr;
    gap: 45px;
  }


  .policy-number {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: #917552;
  }


  .policy-section > div {
    max-width: 760px;
  }


  .policy-section h2 {
    margin: 0 0 25px;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 400;
  }


  .policy-section p {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: #5d564c;
  }


  .policy-email {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 5px;
    color: #29251f;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: 24px;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(41, 37, 31, 0.35);
  }


  .policy-email:hover {
    opacity: 0.65;
  }


  .policy-final {
    padding: 110px 40px;
    text-align: center;
    background: #29251f;
    color: #f8f5ef;
  }


  .policy-final h2 {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto 35px;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 55px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    font-weight: 400;
  }


  .policy-final .product-shop-button {
    display: inline-block;
  }


  @media (max-width: 700px) {

    .policy-hero,
    .policy-content,
    .policy-final {
      padding-left: 22px;
      padding-right: 22px;
    }


    .policy-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 45px 0;
    }


    .policy-hero {
      padding-top: 70px;
      padding-bottom: 70px;
    }


    .policy-email {
      font-size: 20px;
    }

  }

</style>